[{"id":634,"name":"AlphaRAR.aRTS_prop_dev","kind":"Theorem","keyword":"theorem","module":"AlphaRAR.YDK2026.PropDevARTS","package":"AlphaRAR","isProp":true,"hashes":{"meaning":"613c034e1d669129","local":"7337ddbbe4144107","content":"6001bcf641b0957b"},"doc":"**Deviation between proportions and plug-in target for the aRTS design** (equation (5) of\nTheorem 4.2 (i) of the paper). For every arm `k`, `|N_{n,k} - n ρ̂_{n,k}| = o_p(√n)`.\n\nThe `aRTS` instantiation of `prop_dev_of_hitting` at the last under-sampling time\n`hitting (aRTSUnder …)`, fully self-contained: the consistencies `θ̂ → θ`\n(`aRTS_theta_consistent`), `N/n → v` (`aRTS_proportion_tendsto`), the throttle\n(`throttle_of_isARTS`, from the algorithm-level `IsARTS` predicate), and the smallness are all\ndischarged from the same `aRTS_LLN` design bundle — an `IsAlgEnvSeq` sequence, `Y ∈ L²`\n(Condition **A**), a simplex-valued `LipschitzWith K` target `T` (Condition **B**), `α ∈ [0,1)`,\nand the non-sparsity `hTpos`. The smallness is automatic: at the last under-sampling time\n`N_ℓ - ℓ ρ̂_ℓ ≤ 0` (`preliminary_small`), so `(1 + N_ℓ - ℓ ρ̂_ℓ)^+/√n ≤ 1/√n = o_p(1)`. The a.s.\n`O(√(n log log n))` bounds are a separate statement. ","statement":{"binders":[{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"Ω","role":"type","type":"Type u_1","typeRefs":[]},{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"𝓐","role":"type","type":"Type u_2","typeRefs":[]},{"explicit":false,"head":"MeasurableSpace","implicit":true,"name":"mΩ","role":"instance","type":"MeasurableSpace Ω","typeRefs":[[0,15,"MeasurableSpace"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"MeasurableSpace","implicit":true,"name":"m𝓐","role":"instance","type":"MeasurableSpace 𝓐","typeRefs":[[0,15,"MeasurableSpace"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"MeasurableSingletonClass","implicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"MeasurableSingletonClass 𝓐","typeRefs":[[0,24,"MeasurableSingletonClass"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"ProbabilityTheory.Kernel","implicit":true,"name":"ν","role":"variable","type":"ProbabilityTheory.Kernel 𝓐 ℝ","typeRefs":[[0,24,"ProbabilityTheory.Kernel"],[27,28,"Real"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"ProbabilityTheory.IsMarkovKernel","implicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"ProbabilityTheory.IsMarkovKernel ν","typeRefs":[[0,32,"ProbabilityTheory.IsMarkovKernel"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"MeasureTheory.Measure","implicit":true,"name":"P","role":"variable","type":"MeasureTheory.Measure Ω","typeRefs":[[0,21,"MeasureTheory.Measure"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"MeasureTheory.IsProbabilityMeasure","implicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"MeasureTheory.IsProbabilityMeasure P","typeRefs":[[0,34,"MeasureTheory.IsProbabilityMeasure"]]},{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"O","role":"variable","type":"ℕ → Ω → Unit","typeRefs":[[0,1,"Nat"],[8,12,"Unit"]]},{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"A","role":"variable","type":"ℕ → Ω → 𝓐","typeRefs":[[0,1,"Nat"]]},{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"Y","role":"variable","type":"ℕ → Ω → ℝ","typeRefs":[[0,1,"Nat"],[8,9,"Real"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"Learning.Algorithm","implicit":true,"name":"alg","role":"variable","type":"Learning.Algorithm Unit 𝓐 ℝ","typeRefs":[[0,18,"Learning.Algorithm"],[19,23,"Unit"],[26,27,"Real"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"Fintype","implicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"Fintype 𝓐","typeRefs":[[0,7,"Fintype"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"DecidableEq","implicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"DecidableEq 𝓐","typeRefs":[[0,11,"DecidableEq"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"StandardBorelSpace","implicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"StandardBorelSpace 𝓐","typeRefs":[[0,18,"StandardBorelSpace"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"Nonempty","implicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"Nonempty 𝓐","typeRefs":[[0,8,"Nonempty"]]},{"explicit":true,"head":"Learning.IsAlgEnvSeq","implicit":false,"name":"h","role":"hypothesis","type":"Learning.IsAlgEnvSeq O A Y alg (Learning.stationaryEnv ν) P","typeRefs":[[0,20,"Learning.IsAlgEnvSeq"],[32,54,"Learning.stationaryEnv"]]},{"explicit":true,"implicit":false,"name":"hνk","role":"hypothesis","type":"∀ (a : 𝓐), MeasureTheory.MemLp id 2 (ν a)","typeRefs":[[11,30,"MeasureTheory.MemLp"],[31,33,"id"]]},{"explicit":true,"implicit":false,"name":"θ₀","role":"variable","type":"𝓐 → ℝ","typeRefs":[[4,5,"Real"]]},{"explicit":true,"implicit":false,"name":"T","role":"variable","type":"(𝓐 → ℝ) → 𝓐 → ℝ","typeRefs":[[5,6,"Real"],[14,15,"Real"]]},{"explicit":true,"implicit":false,"name":"hTnn","role":"hypothesis","type":"∀ (z : 𝓐 → ℝ) (k : 𝓐), 0 ≤ T z k","typeRefs":[[11,12,"Real"],[25,26,"LE.le"]]},{"explicit":true,"implicit":false,"name":"hTsum","role":"hypothesis","type":"∀ (z : 𝓐 → ℝ), ∑ k, T z k = 1","typeRefs":[[11,12,"Real"],[26,27,"Eq"]]},{"explicit":true,"head":"Real","implicit":false,"name":"α","role":"variable","type":"ℝ","typeRefs":[[0,1,"Real"]]},{"explicit":true,"head":"Membership.mem","implicit":false,"name":"hα","role":"hypothesis","type":"α ∈ Set.Icc 0 1","typeRefs":[[2,3,"Membership.mem"],[4,11,"Set.Icc"]]},{"explicit":true,"head":"LT.lt","implicit":false,"name":"hα1","role":"hypothesis","type":"α < 1","typeRefs":[[2,3,"LT.lt"]]},{"explicit":true,"head":"AlphaRAR.IsARTS","implicit":false,"name":"hARTS","role":"hypothesis","type":"IsARTS alg θ₀ T α","typeRefs":[[0,6,"AlphaRAR.IsARTS"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"NNReal","implicit":true,"name":"K","role":"variable","type":"NNReal","typeRefs":[[0,6,"NNReal"]]},{"explicit":true,"head":"LipschitzWith","implicit":false,"name":"hlip","role":"hypothesis","type":"LipschitzWith K T","typeRefs":[[0,13,"LipschitzWith"]]},{"explicit":true,"implicit":false,"name":"hTpos","role":"hypothesis","type":"∀ (z : 𝓐 → ℝ), (∀ (k : 𝓐), z k ∈ attainableSet A Y (θ₀ k) k) → ∀ (k : 𝓐), 0 < T z k","typeRefs":[[11,12,"Real"],[31,32,"Membership.mem"],[33,46,"AlphaRAR.attainableSet"],[76,77,"LT.lt"]]},{"explicit":true,"implicit":false,"name":"k","role":"variable","type":"𝓐","typeRefs":[]}],"conclusion":"IsLittleOpOne P fun n ω => (↑(Learning.pullCount A k n ω) - ↑n * aRTSTarget A Y θ₀ T n ω k) / √↑n","conclusionHead":"AlphaRAR.IsLittleOpOne","conclusionRefs":[[0,13,"AlphaRAR.IsLittleOpOne"],[30,48,"Learning.pullCount"],[58,59,"HSub.hSub"],[63,64,"HMul.hMul"],[65,75,"AlphaRAR.aRTSTarget"],[92,93,"HDiv.hDiv"],[94,95,"Real.sqrt"]],"decl":"AlphaRAR.aRTS_prop_dev"},"code":"/-- **Deviation between proportions and plug-in target for the aRTS design** (equation (5) of\nTheorem 4.2 (i) of the paper). For every arm `k`, `|N_{n,k} - n ρ̂_{n,k}| = o_p(√n)`.\n\nThe `aRTS` instantiation of `prop_dev_of_hitting` at the last under-sampling time\n`hitting (aRTSUnder …)`, fully self-contained: the consistencies `θ̂ → θ`\n(`aRTS_theta_consistent`), `N/n → v` (`aRTS_proportion_tendsto`), the throttle\n(`throttle_of_isARTS`, from the algorithm-level `IsARTS` predicate), and the smallness are all\ndischarged from the same `aRTS_LLN` design bundle — an `IsAlgEnvSeq` sequence, `Y ∈ L²`\n(Condition **A**), a simplex-valued `LipschitzWith K` target `T` (Condition **B**), `α ∈ [0,1)`,\nand the non-sparsity `hTpos`. The smallness is automatic: at the last under-sampling time\n`N_ℓ - ℓ ρ̂_ℓ ≤ 0` (`preliminary_small`), so `(1 + N_ℓ - ℓ ρ̂_ℓ)^+/√n ≤ 1/√n = o_p(1)`. The a.s.\n`O(√(n log log n))` bounds are a separate statement. -/\ntheorem aRTS_prop_dev [Fintype 𝓐] [DecidableEq 𝓐] [StandardBorelSpace 𝓐] [Nonempty 𝓐]\n    (h : IsAlgEnvSeq O A Y alg (stationaryEnv ν) P) (hνk : ∀ a, MemLp id 2 (ν a))\n    (θ₀ : 𝓐 → ℝ) (T : (𝓐 → ℝ) → 𝓐 → ℝ)\n    (hTnn : ∀ z k, 0 ≤ T z k) (hTsum : ∀ z, ∑ k, T z k = 1)\n    (α : ℝ) (hα : α ∈ Set.Icc (0 : ℝ) 1) (hα1 : α < 1) (hARTS : IsARTS alg θ₀ T α)\n    {K : ℝ≥0} (hlip : LipschitzWith K T)\n    (hTpos : ∀ z : 𝓐 → ℝ, (∀ k, z k ∈ attainableSet A Y (θ₀ k) k) → ∀ k, 0 < T z k) (k : 𝓐) :\n    IsLittleOpOne P (fun n ω ↦ ((pullCount A k n ω : ℝ)\n      - (n : ℝ) * aRTSTarget A Y θ₀ T n ω k) / √n)","proof":":= by\n  have hT : Continuous T := hlip.continuous\n  exact prop_dev_of_hitting h hνk θ₀ T hTnn hTsum α hα hα1 hlip hTpos\n    (aRTS_theta_consistent h hνk hT hTnn hTsum hα hARTS hTpos)\n    (fun k' ↦ aRTS_proportion_tendsto h hνk hT hTnn hTsum hα hARTS hTpos k')\n    (aRTSUnder A Y θ₀ T) (fun k m ↦ measurableSet_aRTSUnder h θ₀ hT k m)\n    (fun k ↦ throttle_of_isARTS h hARTS k) (aRTS_smallness_op θ₀ T) k","source":{"path":"AlphaRAR/YDK2026/PropDevARTS.lean","start":688,"end":714,"url":"https://github.com/RemyDegenne/alpha-rar/blob/e7164a80baea3f4f65e108de31d2d561dd35e350/AlphaRAR/YDK2026/PropDevARTS.lean#L688-L714"},"deps":[356,385,393,748],"outside":[],"external":[["AddCommMonoid","mathlib","class"],["AddCommMonoidWithOne.toAddMonoidWithOne","mathlib","instance"],["AddMonoidWithOne.toNatCast","mathlib","instance"],["ContinuousENorm.toENorm","mathlib","instance"],["DFunLike.coe","mathlib","definition"],["DecidableEq","lean4","definition"],["DivInvMonoid.toDiv","mathlib","instance"],["EMetricSpace.toPseudoEMetricSpace","mathlib","instance"],["EMetricSpace.toWeakEMetricSpace","mathlib","instance"],["ENNReal","mathlib","definition"],["ENNReal.instAddCommMonoidWithOne","mathlib","instance"],["ENNReal.toReal","mathlib","definition"],["Eq","lean4","inductive"],["Filter.atTop","mathlib","definition"],["Fin","lean4","structure"],["Finset.range","mathlib","definition"],["Finset.sum","mathlib","definition"],["Finset.univ","mathlib","definition"],["Fintype","mathlib","class"],["HAdd.hAdd","lean4","definition"],["HDiv.hDiv","lean4","definition"],["HMul.hMul","lean4","definition"],["HSub.hSub","lean4","definition"],["LE.le","lean4","definition"],["LT.lt","lean4","definition"],["Learning.Algorithm","LeanMachineLearning","structure"],["Learning.Algorithm.policy","LeanMachineLearning","definition"],["Learning.Hist","LeanMachineLearning","definition"],["Learning.IsAlgEnvSeq","LeanMachineLearning","structure"],["Learning.Round","LeanMachineLearning","definition"],["Learning.actionIndicator","LeanMachineLearning","definition"],["Learning.pullCount","LeanMachineLearn